{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, [3,1,0]⊗[3,1,0]: two distinct rotations with a determinant overlap — the §10 recipe of `L2-rotation-sov.wb` for the next rep (2026-10-09)\n\n**Goal (Paul).** Generalize the adjoint result (`Two-rotations-det-overlap.md`: $v_2=\\Omega_{(w_1,y^*)}$, $v_1=v_2\\rho((w_2-G^T)^{-1})$, overlap $\\propto\\det_6\\times$ ladder-1 contour $\\det_2$) to $\\Lambda=[3,1,0]$ (dim 15, 225 states).\n\n**Recipe** (memory `project_two_rotations_det_overlap`): (1) localization of $T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-\\lambda_1h)$ on $\\langle\\Omega_w\\otimes\\Omega_w|$ — known for [3,1,0] (`L2-310-localization.md`): $T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,2)},T_{(3,2)}$ at $\\theta_1-3h$; (2) site-2 column space of the non-localizing shapes; (3) exact product locus in the linear span; (4) identify the factors (vacua $\\Omega_{(p,q)}$, resolvents, torus) and the overlap as a $T$-eigenvalue combination; (5) quotient by the ket-twist torus before counting parameters; (6) only then the Q-determinant form.\n\n**Conventions.** New conventions, plain GT generators `JJ` (not EH: exact rationals throughout, sparse 225×225), Lax $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=(u-\\theta_s)\\delta_{ij}+hE_{ij}$, twist on the right, CBR fusion $T_\\lambda(x)=\\det_{i,j}t_{\\lambda'_j+i-j}(x+(i-1)h)$ with shapes labelled by row lengths $(\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2)$. Numeric point P1: $h=1/2$, $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$. Diagonal frame (ket twist diag$(z)$, bra vacuum $\\Omega_1=e_1^T e^{r_1E_{12}}e^{r_2E_{13}}e^{r_3E_{23}}$ with the rep-independent $r_k(z,w)$). Runs on its own kernel (K310).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state for this notebook (private kernel K310; the adjoint notebook's kernel K1 is untouched) *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;\n(* rep, numeric point P1, sparse exact generators *)\nΛ = {3, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; θ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\nid1 = IdentityMatrix[d1, SparseArray]; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, Λ]];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], id1]; E2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, Ee[i, j]];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1]; kron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\n(* exp of a nilpotent matrix: finite sum from the identity (MatrixPower[nilpotent, 0] errors) *)\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"dims (one site, two sites)\", {d1, d2}}, {\"# weight sectors\", Length[Union[wtBasis]]}, {\"HW pattern = index 1\", ps[{Λ}][[1]]}, {\"e1.E12, e1.E21 nonzero?\", {Norm[Normal[e1 . Ee[1, 2]]] != 0, Norm[Normal[e1 . Ee[2, 1]]] != 0}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
