  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* twisted vacuum, frames and the rotation test. Group-level data are rep-independent (same r_k(z,w), P_aux, rsSol as in the adjoint notebooks). Diagonal frame: ket twist diag(z); the bra twist is G' = P_aux G(w) P_aux^-1 and Ω⊗Ω is its exact left eigen-covector. *)\nrOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]), ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])), ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nRrot[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[r[[1]] Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] Ee[2, 3]]];\nOm1[zv_, wv_] := Normal[e1 . Rrot[zv, wv]];\nΩ1 = Om1[zN, wN]; Ω2 = kron[Ω1, Ω1];\nee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nGc[tw_] := {{Total[tw], -(tw[[1]] tw[[2]] + tw[[1]] tw[[3]] + tw[[2]] tw[[3]]), Times @@ tw}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nrsSol[zv_] := {s1 -> zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), s2 -> -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), s3 -> 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]]), ρ1 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), ρ2 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), ρ3 -> (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPaux[zv_] := (MatrixExp[-ρ1 ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ2 ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ3 ee[1, 2]] . DiagonalMatrix[1/{s1, s2, s3}] . MatrixExp[-(1/zv[[1]]) ee[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 2]]) /. rsSol[zv];\nGP = Paux[zN] . Gc[wN] . Inverse[Paux[zN]];\nchecks[\"Paux diagonalizes G(z)\"] = (Paux[zN] . Gc[zN] . Inverse[Paux[zN]] == DiagonalMatrix[zN]);\nchecks[\"Ω⊗Ω left eigenvector of t_a(G'), a=1,2,3 (exact)\"] = Table[With[{c = Normal[Ω2 . tL2[a, 2/9, GP]]}, Union[Flatten[c - (c[[1]]/Ω2[[1]]) Ω2]] === {0}], {a, 3}];\n(* physical Gauss factors (companion frame) and the SoV vacuum x0 = (e1 P_phys^-1)^{⊗2}; only needed for normalizations later *)\nPphys[zv_] := With[{q = rsSol[zv]}, nexp[(ρ1 /. q) Ee[3, 2]] . nexp[(ρ2 /. q) Ee[3, 1]] . nexp[(ρ3 /. q) Ee[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[({s1, s2, s3}[[k]] /. q)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexp[(1/zv[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]]];\nPph1 = Normal[Pphys[zN]]; PphInv1 = Inverse[Pph1]; x01 = e1 . PphInv1; x02 = kron[x01, x01];\nρdiag[d_] := DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[d[[k]]^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nDy[y1_] := Table[1/(y1 - zN[[i]]), {i, 3}];\n(* rotation test for a 15-dim covector: φ ∈ GL(3)·e1 iff the stabilizer of the line [φ] is the 6-dim Borel iff rank{φ, φ.E_ij (9)} = 10 - 6 = 4 (exact, linear; a generic covector gives 10) *)\nrotRank[φ_] := MatrixRank[Join[{Normal[φ]}, Flatten[Table[Normal[φ . Ee[i, j]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]]];\nSeedRandom[3]; φrnd = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, d1];\nchecks[\"rotRank: e1, Ω1, x01, Ω1ρ(D), Ω(z,w')\"] = {rotRank[e1], rotRank[Ω1], rotRank[x01], rotRank[Ω1 . ρdiag[{2/3, -5/7, 4}]], rotRank[Om1[zN, {7/4, -2/5, 9/7}]]};\nchecks[\"rotRank: random covector\"] = rotRank[φrnd];\nGrid[{{\"Paux diagonalizes G(z)\", checks[\"Paux diagonalizes G(z)\"]}, {\"Ω⊗Ω eigenvector of t_a(G') (exact)\", checks[\"Ω⊗Ω left eigenvector of t_a(G'), a=1,2,3 (exact)\"]}, {\"rotRank {e1, Ω1, x01, Ω1ρ(D), Ω(z,w')} (4 = rotation)\", checks[\"rotRank: e1, Ω1, x01, Ω1ρ(D), Ω(z,w')\"]}, {\"rotRank random (10 = generic)\", checks[\"rotRank: random covector\"]}, {\"<x0|Ω> nonzero\", x02 . Ω2 != 0}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"125\" data-out-n=\"508\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[508]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Paux diagonalizes G(z)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω eigenvector of t_a(G’) (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rotRank {e1, Ω1, x01, Ω1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(D), Ω(z,w’)} (4 = rotation)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rotRank random (10 = generic)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;x0|Ω&gt; nonzero</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
