  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* localization at v0 = θ1 - 3h for every CBR shape with λ1 ≤ 3 (row-length labels), and the site-2 span. Covector <Ω|T_λ as the 15x15 matrix M[a,b], a = site 1, b = site 2: its ROWS are the site-2 covectors. Site-1 local <=> rank 1 with site-2 factor Ω1 (known for [3,1,0]: (1,1), (2,2), (3,2)). *)\nshapes = {{1, 0}, {1, 1}, {2, 0}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 0}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}, {3, 3}};\n{tT, Tv0} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[λ -> TL2[λ, v0, Zd], {λ, shapes}]]];\nMl[λ_] := Ml[λ] = Partition[Normal[Ω2 . Tv0[λ]], d1];\nrowSpaceDim[M_] := MatrixRank[M];\nextraDim[M_] := MatrixRank[Join[M, {Ω1}]] - MatrixRank[M];   (* 0 iff Ω1 lies in the site-2 span of M *)\nlocTab = Table[With[{M = Ml[λ]}, {λ, rowSpaceDim[M], extraDim[M], rowSpaceDim[M] == 1 && extraDim[M] == 0}], {λ, shapes}];\nlocShapes = Select[shapes, locTab[[Position[shapes, #][[1, 1]], 4]] &]; nonLoc = Complement[shapes, locShapes];\nrJoint = MatrixRank[Join[{Ω1}, Flatten[Table[Ml[λ], {λ, shapes}], 1]]];\nrNonLocEach = Table[{λ, MatrixRank[Join[{Ω1}, Ml[λ]]]}, {λ, nonLoc}];\nchecks[\"localizing shapes at θ1-3h\"] = locShapes;\nchecks[\"joint site-2 span dim (Ω1 + all shapes)\"] = rJoint;\nGrid[Join[{{\"shape\", \"rank of <Ω|T_λ (15x15)\", \"Ω1 outside its site-2 span? (0 = inside)\", \"site-1 local\"}}, locTab, {{\"localizing shapes\", locShapes, \"\", \"\"}, {\"joint site-2 span dim (Ω1 + all shapes)\", rJoint, \"\", \"\"}, {\"dim(Ω1 + span of each non-local shape)\", rNonLocEach, \"\", \"\"}, {\"T time (s)\", tT, \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
