   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site-2 directions beyond Ω1 and the exact product locus in the linear span Φ(c) = <Ω|(c0 + Σ_λ c_λ T_λ(θ1-3h)). Basis β of the joint site-2 span: Ω1 first, then greedily the rows of the non-local <Ω|T_λ that raise the rank (each normalized by its largest entry). Each M_λ = Σ_j A_{λj} ⊗ β_j; Φ(c) is a product iff the r site-1 vectors a_j(c) = Σ_k c_k A_{kj} are all parallel (2x2 minors of the r x 15 matrix vanish). *)\nallMats = Join[{Partition[Ω2, d1]}, Table[Ml[λ], {λ, shapes}]];   (* k = 1: identity; k = 2..10: shapes *)\nopNames = Join[{\"1\"}, (\"T\" <> ToString[#] &) /@ shapes];\nβbasis = Module[{b = {Ω1}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[Table[Ml[λ], {λ, nonLoc}], 1]}]; b];\nrB = Length[βbasis]; checks[\"joint site-2 span: dim\"] = rB;\n(* the extra directions: rotations? is the pencil Ω1 + κ ω inside the rotation orbit? is ω a one-site vacuum Ω_{(p,q)} for (p,q) among the twist parameters? *)\nextras = Rest[βbasis];\nvacCands = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Table[If[p =!= q, {p, q}, Nothing], {p, Join[wN, zN]}, {q, Join[wN, zN]}], 1]];\nvacId[ω_] := Select[vacCands, MatrixRank[{ω, Om1[zN, {#[[1]], #[[2]], 1}]}] == 1 &];\nextraTab = Table[{j + 1, rotRank[extras[[j]]], Table[rotRank[Ω1 + κ extras[[j]]], {κ, {2/3, -5/7, 11/4}}], vacId[extras[[j]]]}, {j, Length[extras]}];\n(* decomposition and the product locus *)\ndecA[M_] := Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[βbasis], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]];   (* r x 15 *)\nAcoef = decA /@ allMats;\ncs = Array[c, Length[allMats], 0];\naOfC = Sum[cs[[k]] Acoef[[k]], {k, Length[allMats]}];\nprodEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[aOfC, 2]]], 0];\n{solTime, solProd} = AbsoluteTiming[Solve[prodEqs == 0, cs]];\nclassifyP[sol_] := Module[{cc, free, M, rowi, colj, f1, f2}, cc = cs /. sol; free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> RandomInteger[{2, 9}, Length[free]]];\n   M = Sum[cc[[k]] allMats[[k]], {k, Length[allMats]}];\n   If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {Length[free], \"zero\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", cc},\n    rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; f1 = M[[All, colj]]; f2 = M[[rowi, All]];\n    {Length[free], Union[Flatten[Minors[M, 2]]] === {0}, rotRank[f1], rotRank[f2], MatrixRank[{f1, Ω1}], MatrixRank[{f2, Ω1}], cc}]];\nSeedRandom[310]; classP = classifyP /@ solProd;\nGrid[Join[{{\"joint site-2 span dim\", rB}, {\"extras: {index, rotRank, rotRank(Ω1+κω) at 3 κ, = Ω_(p,q)?}\", extraTab}, {\"# quadrics, Solve time (s), # components\", {Length[prodEqs], N[solTime, 3], Length[solProd]}}, {\"components: {free params, rank1, rotRank site1, rotRank site2, rank{site1,Ω1}, rank{site2,Ω1}, c}\", \"\"}}, {#} & /@ classP], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">8 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Power::infy: Infinite expression - encountered.                                  0</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Power::infy: Infinite expression - encountered.                                  0</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Infinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0 ComplexInfinity encountered.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">MatrixPower::mindet: Input matrix contains an indeterminate entry.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">MatrixPower::mindet: Input matrix contains an indeterminate entry.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">MatrixPower::mindet: Input matrix contains an indeterminate entry.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of MatrixPower::mindet will be suppressed during this calculation.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">$RecursionLimit::reclim: Recursion depth of 1024 exceeded.</div></details>",
