      {
       "data": "Out[103]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{S1: $\\lambda$1 $\\le$ 4 at $\\theta$1-3h (build time s)} & 1.651908\\\\\\hline\\text{S1 result} & \\begin{matrix}\\text{site-2 span dim}\\to 2\\\\\\text{\\# quadrics}\\to 105\\\\\\text{Solve time (s)}\\to 0.379158\\\\\\text{\\# components}\\to 3\\\\\\text{components \\{free, rotRank site1, rotRank site2, rank\\{site2,$\\Omega$1\\}, support\\}}\\to \\begin{pmatrix}10 & 8 & 4 & 1 & \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{1, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 3\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 3\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 4\\}@-3}\\right\\}\\\\7 & 6 & 4 & 2 & \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{1, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 3\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 3\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{4, 4\\}@-3}\\right\\}\\\\7 & 5 & 4 & 2 & \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{1, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 0\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 1\\}@-3},\\text{T\\{3, 2\\}@-3},… [latex truncated: 7017 chars total]",
