   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* identify the factors of the two product points. Site 2 (a rotation): write it as Ω_{(w1,y)} ρdiag[d] by an exact Solve (w1 is a torus direction, so fix it), which gives its torus invariant y(g) (the adjoint's y* = w2 (θ12-h)/(θ12-2h)). Site 1 (not a rotation): which GL(3)-orbit? Test the seeds e1.E12 (weight (2,2,0), rotRank 5), e1.(E12+E23) (rotRank 6), e1.E13 (7) and e1(1+E12) (5) with a generic Gauss-decomposed g = U- D U+ (9 parameters incl. scale). *)\nsolveVac[g_] := Module[{eqs, sol}, eqs = Thread[(Om1[zN, {-7/3, yv, 3/5}] . ρdiag[{d1v, d2v, 1}]) == sv g]; sol = Solve[eqs, {yv, d1v, d2v, sv}]; Select[sol, (sv /. #) =!= 0 &]];\n{solV2, solV3} = {solveVac[f2P2], solveVac[f2P3]};\nchecks[\"site-2 factors: torus invariant y(g) of components 2, 3\"] = {yv /. solV2, yv /. solV3};\ngGauss = nexp[a1 Ee[2, 1]] . nexp[a2 Ee[3, 1]] . nexp[a3 Ee[3, 2]] . ρdiag[{d1v, d2v, 1}] . nexp[b1 Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[b2 Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[b3 Ee[2, 3]];\nseeds = {\"e1.E12\" -> Normal[e1 . Ee[1, 2]], \"e1.(E12+E23)\" -> Normal[e1 . (Ee[1, 2] + Ee[2, 3])], \"e1.E13\" -> Normal[e1 . Ee[1, 3]], \"e1.(1+E12)\" -> Normal[e1 . (id1 + Ee[1, 2])]};\norbitTest[f_, seed_] := Module[{eqs, sol}, eqs = Thread[Normal[seed . gGauss] == sv f]; sol = TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs, {a1, a2, a3, d1v, d2v, b1, b2, b3, sv}], 120, \"timeout\"]; If[sol === \"timeout\", \"timeout\", Length[Select[sol, (sv /. #) =!= 0 &]]]];\n{tO, orbitTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{nm, rotRank[f], Table[s[[1]] -> orbitTest[f, s[[2]]], {s, seeds}]}, {nm, {\"site1 of comp 2\", \"site1 of comp 3\"}}, {f, {f1P2, f1P3}}] /. {{a_, b_}, {c_, d_}} :> {a, d}];\norbitTab = {{\"site1 of comp 2\", rotRank[f1P2], Table[s[[1]] -> orbitTest[f1P2, s[[2]]], {s, seeds}]}, {\"site1 of comp 3\", rotRank[f1P3], Table[s[[1]] -> orbitTest[f1P3, s[[2]]], {s, seeds}]}};\nchecks[\"site-1 factors: # solutions of f = s seed.ρ(U- D U+) per seed\"] = orbitTab;\nGrid[{{\"site-2 y(g): comp 2, comp 3\", checks[\"site-2 factors: torus invariant y(g) of components 2, 3\"]}, {\"adjoint y* formula w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-2h) and w2(θ12-2h)/(θ12-3h), w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-3h)\", {wN[[2]] (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - 2 hN), wN[[2]] (θ12 - 2 hN)/(θ12 - 3 hN), wN[[2]] (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - 3 hN)}}, {\"site-1 orbit tests {name, rotRank, {seed -> # solutions}}\", Column[orbitTab]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
