  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## §13. Undoing the site-2 rotation for [3,1,0] (spec `site1-Qform/7-undo-site2-rotation-span.md` §5/§7, 2026-10-09)\n\nPoint-B family: v2 = Om1[z,{w1,y-star,w3}] = e1.ρ(n), v1 = e1.(α+βE12).ρ(n).ρdiag[Dy[w2]]; φ = v1.ρ(n)^-1. Question: do the weight-μ projections of φ(w2) span every weight space of [3,1,0] (so every HW CG coefficient is reachable)? All objects exact rationals; globals prefixed u13. Kernel note: this notebook shares kernel K1 with L2-rotation-sov.wb (private kernels would not start); cell 2 wiped that notebook's live state.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* point-B family at six values of w2: re-run pipeline310 per w2 (beta/alpha has no closed form). pipeline310 returns the site-1 factor only as a decomposition, so build u13pipe = pipeline310 with the actual site-1 covector f1 added to each point's record (verbatim source of cell 12, one-line change). *)\nu13src = Import[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], \"L2-310-two-rotations.wb\"}], \"RawJSON\"][\"cells\"][[12]][\"value\"];\nu13def = StringReplace[StringTake[u13src, First[First[StringPosition[u13src, \"\\n{tP, runs}\"]]] - 1], {\"pipeline310\" -> \"u13pipe\", \"{\\\"y(site2)\\\" -> yy,\" -> \"{\\\"f1\\\" -> f1, \\\"y(site2)\\\" -> yy,\"}];\nToExpression[u13def];\nu13w1 = 5/2; u13w3 = 3/5; u13w2s = {7/3, -8/9, 4/27, 3, -1/2, 11/7};\nu13ystar[w2_] := w2 (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - 3 hN);\n{u13t1, u13first} = AbsoluteTiming[u13pipe[zN, {u13w1, u13w2s[[1]], u13w3}, hN, thN]];\nu13runs = <|u13w2s[[1]] -> u13first|>;\n(u13runs[#] = u13pipe[zN, {u13w1, #, u13w3}, hN, thN]) & /@ Rest[u13w2s];\n(* point B = the nontrivial point whose site-2 invariant equals y-star *)\nu13pickB[w2_] := Select[\"nontrivial points\" /. u13runs[w2], ListQ[\"y(site2)\" /. #] && (\"y(site2)\" /. #)[[1]] == u13ystar[w2] &];\nu13B = Association[Table[w2 -> u13pickB[w2], {w2, u13w2s}]];\nu13Bf1 = Association[Table[w2 -> (\"f1\" /. u13B[w2][[1]]), {w2, u13w2s}]];\nu13beta = Association[Table[w2 -> (\"site1 in span{e1RD, e1E12RD}\" /. u13B[w2][[1]]), {w2, u13w2s}]];\nchecks[\"u13 point B found for each w2 (exactly one)\"] = Values[Length /@ u13B];\nchecks[\"u13 beta/alpha(w2)\"] = u13beta;\nchecks[\"u13 beta/alpha(7/3) = 392/2335\"] = ((\"β/α\" /. u13beta[7/3]) == 392/2335);\nGrid[Join[{{\"w2\", \"y-star\", \"β/α\", \"rotRank (site1, site2)\"}}, Table[{w2, u13ystar[w2], \"β/α\" /. u13beta[w2], \"rotRank\" /. u13B[w2][[1]]}, {w2, u13w2s}], {{\"time first call (s)\", u13t1, \"\", \"\"}, {\"β/α(7/3) = 392/2335?\", checks[\"u13 beta/alpha(7/3) = 392/2335\"], \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
