  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the undo: n = N+ Gauss element of v2 (same r_k as the adjoint, rep independent), rho(n) = MatrixExp[r1 E12].MatrixExp[r2 E13].MatrixExp[r3 E23] (15x15), v2 = e1.rho(n), v1 = (alpha e1 + beta e1.E12).rho(n).rho(D_w2) with alpha = 1, phi = v1.rho(n)^-1. *)\nu13r[w2_] := rOm[zN, {u13w1, u13ystar[w2], u13w3}];\nu13rhoN[w2_] := With[{r = u13r[w2]}, MatrixExp[r[[1]] Normal[Ee[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[r[[2]] Normal[Ee[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[r[[3]] Normal[Ee[2, 3]]]];\nu13nMat[w2_] := With[{r = u13r[w2]}, {{1, r[[1]], r[[2]] + r[[1]] r[[3]]}, {0, 1, r[[3]]}, {0, 0, 1}}];\nu13v2[w2_] := Om1[zN, {u13w1, u13ystar[w2], u13w3}];\nu13bt[w2_] := \"β/α\" /. u13beta[w2];\n(* resolvent point variants: Dy[w2] (actual), Dy[y-star] (control, omega = y) *)\nu13v1[w2_, bt_, resolv_] := Normal[(e1 + bt e1 . Ee[1, 2]) . u13rhoN[w2] . ρdiag[Dy[resolv]]];\nu13phi[w2_, bt_, resolv_] := u13v1[w2, bt, resolv] . Inverse[u13rhoN[w2]];\nchecks[\"u13 y-star never equals a z_k or w2 (so Dy finite)\"] = And @@ Table[FreeQ[zN, u13ystar[w2]] && u13ystar[w2] =!= w2, {w2, u13w2s}];\nchecks[\"u13 v2 == e1.rho(n) exactly (MatrixExp), all w2\"] = Table[u13v2[w2] == Normal[e1 . u13rhoN[w2]], {w2, u13w2s}];\nchecks[\"u13 rho(n) == Rrot (nexp version)\"] = Table[u13rhoN[w2] == Normal[Rrot[zN, {u13w1, u13ystar[w2], u13w3}]], {w2, u13w2s}];\nchecks[\"u13 rho(n) is the representation of the 3x3 N+ matrix (E-products of the r_k): n 3x3 upper unipotent\"] = Table[u13nMat[w2] == MatrixExp[u13r[w2][[1]] ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[u13r[w2][[2]] ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[u13r[w2][[3]] ee[2, 3]], {w2, u13w2s}];\n(* reconstruction of site 1 against the actual covector f1 found by the pipeline (rank 1 of the pair) *)\nchecks[\"u13 reconstructed v1 parallel to pipeline f1 (rank 1)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[{u13v1[w2, u13bt[w2], w2], Normal[u13Bf1[w2]]}] == 1, {w2, u13w2s}];\nu13s = Table[u13v2[w2][[1]], {w2, u13w2s}];\nGrid[{{\"v2 == e1.rho(n)\", checks[\"u13 v2 == e1.rho(n) exactly (MatrixExp), all w2\"]}, {\"rho(n) == Rrot\", checks[\"u13 rho(n) == Rrot (nexp version)\"]}, {\"3x3 n = product of exponentials\", checks[\"u13 rho(n) is the representation of the 3x3 N+ matrix (E-products of the r_k): n 3x3 upper unipotent\"]}, {\"v1 reconstruction parallel to pipeline f1\", checks[\"u13 reconstructed v1 parallel to pipeline f1 (rank 1)\"]}, {\"s = e1-component of v2\", u13s}, {\"r_k for w2 = 7/3\", u13r[7/3]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607003\" data-output-id=\"70\" data-out-n=\"955\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[955]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.25em;vertical-align:-3.355em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.895em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.855em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.855em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.21em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.355em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.855em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v2 == e1.rho(n)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rho(n) == Rrot</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3x3 n = product of exponentials</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.415em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v1 reconstruction parallel to pipeline f1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s = e1-component of v2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r_k for w2 = 7/3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.355em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.21em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.355em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.855em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span c