  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* HW kets of [3,1,0] x [3,1,0] (225-dim): common null space of the total raising generators within each total-weight sector. Which of E_ij, i<j / i>j annihilates the ket e1 in this convention? (covector e1.E12 != 0 was seen in cell 2; the ket is the transpose picture.) *)\nu13ketAnn = {Norm[Normal[Ee[1, 2] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 1] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 3] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[3, 2] . e1]]};\n(* raising for kets = the E_ij (i<j) that kill the ket e1; choose automatically *)\nu13raise = If[u13ketAnn[[1]] == 0 && u13ketAnn[[3]] == 0, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}}, {{2, 1}, {3, 2}}];\nchecks[\"u13 ket e1 annihilated by E_ij with (i,j) =\"] = u13raise;\nu13Etot = Normal[(E1 @@ # + E2 @@ #)] & /@ u13raise;\nu13sectors = Union[wtBasis];\nu13HWlist = Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = secOf[μ], A, ns}, A = Join @@ (#[[All, idx]] & /@ u13Etot); ns = NullSpace[A]; Table[<|\"wt\" -> μ, \"vec\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, d2], Thread[idx -> n]]|>, {n, ns}]], {μ, u13sectors}], 1];\nu13HW = Transpose[u13HWlist[[All, \"vec\"]]];  (* 225 x nHW *)\nu13HWwt = u13HWlist[[All, \"wt\"]];\nu13Tally = Tally[u13HWwt];\nchecks[\"u13 HW weights/multiplicities\"] = u13Tally;\nchecks[\"u13 number of HW kets (expect 10)\"] = Length[u13HWlist];\nchecks[\"u13 HW kets killed by total raising\"] = And @@ Table[Norm[Flatten[Normal[(E1 @@ r + E2 @@ r) . u13HW]]] == 0, {r, u13raise}];\n(* exactness of the undo: (rho(n) x rho(n)).HW == HW, and the overlap identity <v1 x v2|HW> = s <phi x e1|HW> *)\nchecks[\"u13 (rho(n) x rho(n)).HW == HW (two w2)\"] = Table[With[{R = u13rhoN[w2]}, KroneckerProduct[R, R] . u13HW == u13HW], {w2, {7/3, -1/2}}];\nchecks[\"u13 <v1 x v2|HW> == s <phi x e1|HW> (all w2, all HW)\"] = Table[kron[u13v1[w2, u13bt[w2], w2], u13v2[w2]] . u13HW == u13v2[w2][[1]] kron[u13phi[w2, u13bt[w2], w2], e1] . u13HW, {w2, u13w2s}];\nGrid[{{\"ket e1 annihilated by (norms of E12.e1, E21.e1, E23.e1, E32.e1)\", u13ketAnn}, {\"raising pairs used\", u13raise}, {\"# HW kets\", Length[u13HWlist]}, {\"HW weights {wt, mult}\", Column[u13Tally]}, {\"HW killed by total raising\", checks[\"u13 HW kets killed by total raising\"]}, {\"(rho(n) x rho(n)).HW == HW  (w2 = 7/3, -1/2)\", checks[\"u13 (rho(n) x rho(n)).HW == HW (two w2)\"]}, {\"<v1 x v2|HW> == s <phi x e1|HW>\", checks[\"u13 <v1 x v2|HW> == s <phi x e1|HW> (all w2, all HW)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
