  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* extra controls with the same 12 random (w2, D): (b) beta = 0 (rotation part only) and (c0) resolvent y-star with beta = 0 -- the pure adjoint-like control. *)\nu13torusRow0[c_, D_, resolv_] := Module[{v2 = u13v2[c], v1 = u13v1[c, 0, resolv], rD = ρdiag[D]}, kron[v1 . rD, v2 . rD] . u13HW];\nu13MTb = Table[u13torusRow0[u13rndW2[[i]], u13rndD[[i]], u13rndW2[[i]]], {i, 12}];\nu13MTc0 = Table[u13torusRow0[u13rndW2[[i]], u13rndD[[i]], u13ystar[u13rndW2[[i]]]], {i, 12}];\nu13hwTor[\"b\"] = {MatrixRank[u13MTb], u13perIrrep[u13MTb]}; u13hwTor[\"c0\"] = {MatrixRank[u13MTc0], u13perIrrep[u13MTc0]};\nchecks[\"u13 HW rank torus-completed (b, c0)\"] = {u13hwTor[\"b\"][[1]], u13hwTor[\"c0\"][[1]]};\nGrid[Join[{{\"variant\", \"HW rank torus-completed\", \"per irrep {irrep, mult, rank, nonzero}\"}}, Table[{t, u13hwTor[t][[1]], Column[u13rowTab[u13hwTor[t]]]}, {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}], {{\"[4,2,2] and [3,3,2] reached by (a) torus-completed?\", (u13hwTor[\"a\"][[2, All, 3]] // Take[#, 2] &), \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
