  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 3x3 closed form: n' = Delta^-1 n Delta n^-1 (upper unipotent), Delta = diag(1/(w2 - z_k)), y-star symbolic, w2 = y-star (th12 - 3h)/(th12 - h). Claim: b'/(a' c') = (y-star - w2)/(y-star - z2) (w1-independent; non-constant in y-star, and b' != 0 because w2 != y-star). Verified with symbolic y, w1, th12, h and rational z (then also symbolic z). *)\nClear[u13y, u13w1s, u13t, u13hs, u13z1, u13z2, u13z3];\nu13check3[zv_, w1v_, yv_, w2v_] := Module[{r = rOm[zv, {w1v, yv, 1}], n, Δ, np, ap, bp, cp}, n = {{1, r[[1]], r[[2]] + r[[1]] r[[3]]}, {0, 1, r[[3]]}, {0, 0, 1}}; Δ = DiagonalMatrix[1/(w2v - zv)]; np = Simplify[Inverse[Δ] . n . Δ . Inverse[n]]; {ap, bp, cp} = {np[[1, 2]], np[[1, 3]], np[[2, 3]]}; {Simplify[bp/(ap cp) - (yv - w2v)/(yv - zv[[2]])], np[[2, 1]] == 0 && np[[3, 1]] == 0 && np[[3, 2]] == 0 && np[[1, 1]] == 1, {ap, bp, cp}}];\nu13w2Sym = u13y (u13t - 3 u13hs)/(u13t - u13hs);\n{u13t3a, u13id1} = AbsoluteTiming[u13check3[zN, u13w1s, u13y, u13w2Sym]];\n{u13t3b, u13id2} = AbsoluteTiming[u13check3[{u13z1, u13z2, u13z3}, u13w1s, u13y, u13w2Sym]];\nchecks[\"u13 3x3 identity b'/(a'c') = (y-star - w2)/(y-star - z2), symbolic y,w1,th12,h; rational z\"] = u13id1[[1 ;; 2]];\nchecks[\"u13 3x3 identity, fully symbolic z\"] = u13id2[[1 ;; 2]];\nchecks[\"u13 b' != 0 (generic), b' = 0 iff w2 = y-star\"] = {Simplify[u13id1[[3, 2]] /. u13t -> 31/35 /. u13hs -> 1/2] =!= 0, Simplify[u13check3[zN, u13w1s, u13y, u13y][[3, 2]]]};\n(* fixed torus (D = 1) with the 12 random w2 instead of the six: variant (a) HW rank *)\nu13fix12 = Table[kron[u13v1[c, u13rndBeta[c], c], u13v2[c]] . u13HW, {c, u13rndW2}];\nu13fix12c0 = Table[kron[u13v1[c, 0, u13ystar[c]], u13v2[c]] . u13HW, {c, u13rndW2}];\nchecks[\"u13 HW rank fixed torus, 12 random w2 (a), (c0)\"] = {MatrixRank[u13fix12], MatrixRank[u13fix12c0]};\nGrid[{{\"b'/(a'c') - (y-star - w2)/(y-star - z2): rational z, symbolic y, w1, th12, h\", u13id1[[1]], \"upper unipotent n'?\", u13id1[[2]]}, {\"same, symbolic z\", u13id2[[1]], \"\", u13id2[[2]]}, {\"b' with w2 -> y-star (control)\", checks[\"u13 b' != 0 (generic), b' = 0 iff w2 = y-star\"], \"\", \"\"}, {\"HW rank at fixed torus D = 1 with 12 random w2: (a), (c0)\", checks[\"u13 HW rank fixed torus, 12 random w2 (a), (c0)\"], \"\", \"\"}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
