   "value": "(* LW kets of V x V: joint null space of the total lowering generators E_ij (i>j) per total-weight sector; then the undo in the LW frame phi' = f1.rho(m)^-1. f1 = the point-B site-1 covector normalized with alpha = 1 (the pipeline's f1 is only fixed up to a scalar; checked parallel to it, rank 1, as in cell 26). *)\nu14lower = {{2, 1}, {3, 2}};\nu14Elow = Normal[(E1 @@ # + E2 @@ #)] & /@ u14lower;\nu14LWlist = Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = secOf[μ], A, ns}, A = Join @@ (#[[All, idx]] & /@ u14Elow); ns = NullSpace[A]; Table[<|\"wt\" -> μ, \"vec\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, d2], Thread[idx -> n]]|>, {n, ns}]], {μ, u13sectors}], 1];\nu14LW = Transpose[u14LWlist[[All, \"vec\"]]];\nu14LWwt = u14LWlist[[All, \"wt\"]];\nchecks[\"u14 number of LW kets (expect 10)\"] = Length[u14LWlist];\nchecks[\"u14 LW weights == reverses of HW weights\"] = Sort[u14LWwt] === Sort[Reverse /@ u13HWwt];\nchecks[\"u14 LW killed by total lowering; e_low x e_low is LW\"] = {And @@ Table[Norm[Flatten[Normal[(E1 @@ r + E2 @@ r) . u14LW]]] == 0, {r, u14lower}], Union[Flatten[kron[u14elow, u14elow] . u14LW]] =!= {0}};\nchecks[\"u14 (rho(m) x rho(m)).LW == LW (all six w2)\"] = Table[With[{R = u14rho[w2]}, KroneckerProduct[R, R] . u14LW == u14LW], {w2, u13w2s}];\nu14f1[w2_] := u13v1[w2, u13bt[w2], w2];\nu14phi[w2_] := u14f1[w2] . Inverse[u14rho[w2]];\nchecks[\"u14 reconstructed f1 parallel to pipeline f1 (rank 1)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[{u14f1[w2], Normal[u13Bf1[w2]]}] == 1, {w2, u13w2s}];\n(* v2 = s e_low.rho(m), so <f1 x v2|LW> = s <phi' x e_low|LW> *)\nchecks[\"u14 <f1 x v2|LW> == s <phi' x e_low|LW> (all w2, all 10 LW)\"] = Table[kron[u14f1[w2], u13v2[w2]] . u14LW == u14s[w2] kron[u14phi[w2], u14elow] . u14LW, {w2, u13w2s}];\nGrid[{{\"# LW kets\", Length[u14LWlist]}, {\"LW weights\", Column[Tally[u14LWwt]]}, {\"weights = reverses of HW\", checks[\"u14 LW weights == reverses of HW weights\"]}, {\"LW killed by lowering, e_low x e_low is LW\", checks[\"u14 LW killed by total lowering; e_low x e_low is LW\"]}, {\"(rho(m) x rho(m)).LW == LW\", checks[\"u14 (rho(m) x rho(m)).LW == LW (all six w2)\"]}, {\"f1 parallel to pipeline f1\", checks[\"u14 reconstructed f1 parallel to pipeline f1 (rank 1)\"]}, {\"<f1 x v2|LW> == s <phi' x e_low|LW>\", checks[\"u14 <f1 x v2|LW> == s <phi' x e_low|LW> (all w2, all 10 LW)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
