  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* v2_A versus the vacuum rotation e1.rho(n_A), n_A the N+ element of rOm[zN,{w1,y_A,w3}]; if only a torus-rotated vacuum, extract the N+ element n_A' by an exact Solve of e1.rho(exp(r1 E12) exp(r2 E13) exp(r3 E23)) == s f2. *)\nu14rhoNr[r_] := MatrixExp[r[[1]] Normal[Ee[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[r[[2]] Normal[Ee[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[r[[3]] Normal[Ee[2, 3]]];\nu14rA0[w2_] := rOm[zN, {u13w1, u14yA[w2], u13w3}];\nchecks[\"u14 v2_A parallel to e1.rho(n_A) with n_A = rOm[z,{w1,y_A,w3}] ?\"] = Table[MatrixRank[{u14Af2[w2], Normal[e1 . u14rhoNr[u14rA0[w2]]]}] == 1, {w2, u13w2s}];\nu14solA[w2_] := Module[{R = u14rhoNr[{q1, q2, q3}], sol}, sol = Solve[Thread[Normal[e1 . R] == ss u14Af2[w2]], {q1, q2, q3, ss}]; sol];\nu14rAs = Association[Table[w2 -> u14solA[w2], {w2, u13w2s}]];\nchecks[\"u14 v2_A = s e1.rho(n_A') solvable, # solutions\"] = Length /@ Values[u14rAs];\nGrid[{{\"v2_A ∥ e1.rho(n_A) (rOm at y_A)?\", checks[\"u14 v2_A parallel to e1.rho(n_A) with n_A = rOm[z,{w1,y_A,w3}] ?\"]}, {\"# solutions of the exact Solve\", checks[\"u14 v2_A = s e1.rho(n_A') solvable, # solutions\"]}, {\"r(w2=7/3) from rOm at y_A\", u14rA0[7/3]}, {\"Solve r(w2=7/3)\", u14rAs[7/3]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
