      {
       "data": "Out[1110]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{v2\\_A $\\|$ e1.rho(n\\_A) (rOm at y\\_A)?} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# solutions of the exact Solve} & \\left\\{1,1,1,1,1,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{r(w2=7/3) from rOm at y\\_A} & \\left\\{\\frac{4}{5},-\\frac{630}{451},\\frac{1095}{451}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{Solve r(w2=7/3)} & \\left\\{\\left\\{q1\\to \\frac{4}{5},q2\\to -\\frac{630}{451},q3\\to \\frac{1095}{451},\\mathrm{ss}\\to -\\frac{5378240}{852267}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
