  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (a) Is point A's site-1 factor an n+-dressed rotation?  R = rho(n_A) = Rrot[z,{w1,yA,w3}] (cell 38: v2_A = s e1.R).  Test f1_A in span{e1.X.R.D : X in subset of {1,E12,E23,E13}} for D in {rho(Dy[w2]), rho(Dy[yA]), 1}: member iff rank{basis, f1} = rank{basis}; coefficients normalized to alpha = 1 (exact rationals). *)\nu18Xn = {\"1\", \"E12\", \"E23\", \"E13\"};\nu18X = {id1, Ee[1, 2], Ee[2, 3], Ee[1, 3]};\nu18Rm[w2_] := Normal[Rrot[zN, {u13w1, u14yA[w2], u13w3}]];\nu18Dm[w2_, tag_] := Switch[tag, \"Dy[w2]\", ρdiag[Dy[w2]], \"Dy[yA]\", ρdiag[Dy[u14yA[w2]]], \"1\", IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nu18basis[w2_, tag_, sub_] := Table[Normal[e1 . Normal[u18X[[k]]] . u18Rm[w2] . u18Dm[w2, tag]], {k, sub}];\nu18subs = Subsets[Range[4], {1, 4}];\nu18member[w2_, tag_, sub_] := With[{B = u18basis[w2, tag, sub], f = u14Af1[w2]}, MatrixRank[B] == Length[B] && MatrixRank[Append[B, f]] == Length[B]];\nu18Dtags = {\"Dy[w2]\", \"Dy[yA]\", \"1\"};\nu18memTab = Table[{tag, sub, And @@ Table[u18member[w2, tag, sub], {w2, u13w2s}], Table[u18member[w2, tag, sub], {w2, u13w2s}]}, {tag, u18Dtags}, {sub, u18subs}];\nu18hits = Select[Flatten[u18memTab, 1], #[[3]] &];\nchecks[\"u18(a) membership (all six w2) of f1_A: {D, subset indices into {1,E12,E23,E13}}\"] = u18hits[[All, {1, 2}]];\nchecks[\"u18(a) any membership for some but not all w2\"] = Select[Flatten[u18memTab, 1], ! #[[3]] && Or @@ #[[4]] &][[All, {1, 2}]];\n(* the full 4-covector basis at each D: independent? and rank with f1 *)\nu18rank5 = Table[{tag, Table[{MatrixRank[u18basis[w2, tag, {1, 2, 3, 4}]], MatrixRank[Append[u18basis[w2, tag, {1, 2, 3, 4}], u14Af1[w2]]]}, {w2, u13w2s}]}, {tag, u18Dtags}];\nchecks[\"u18(a) ranks {rank 4 basis, rank with f1} per D, per w2\"] = u18rank5;\nGrid[Join[{{\"D\", \"subset of {1,E12,E23,E13}\", \"member at all six w2\", \"per w2\"}}, Flatten[u18memTab, 1]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
