   "value": "(* (a, continued) not a member of the 4-dim spans (rank 5 vs 4 for every D and every w2). Undo the rotation and the torus: g = f1.D^-1.R^-1 should lie in U(n+).e1 = V. Which weights does g occupy, and in which span of descendants e1.(words in E12, E23, E13 of length <= k) does it lie?  (D = Dy[w2], Dy[yA], 1.) *)\nu18wts = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nu18g[w2_, tag_] := u14Af1[w2] . Inverse[u18Dm[w2, tag]] . Inverse[u18Rm[w2]];\nu18words[k_] := Flatten[Table[Tuples[{2, 3, 4}, j], {j, 0, k}], 1];\nu18wordVec[w_] := Normal[Fold[#1 . Normal[u18X[[#2]]] &, e1, w]];\nu18span[k_] := Module[{ws = u18words[k], vs, ind}, vs = u18wordVec /@ ws; ind = {}; Do[If[MatrixRank[vs[[Append[ind, i]]]] > Length[ind], AppendTo[ind, i]], {i, Length[ws]}]; {ws[[ind]], vs[[ind]]}];\nu18sp = Table[u18span[k], {k, 0, 3}];\nchecks[\"u18(a) dim of span e1.(words of length <= k), k = 0..3\"] = Length[#[[1]]] & /@ u18sp;\nu18wtsOf[g_] := Union[Pick[u18wts, Unitize[g], 1]];\nu18gTab = Table[{tag, w2, u18wtsOf[u18g[w2, tag]], Table[With[{B = u18sp[[k + 1, 2]]}, MatrixRank[Append[B, u18g[w2, tag]]] == Length[B]], {k, 0, 3}]}, {tag, u18Dtags}, {w2, {7/3, -1/2}}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"D\", \"w2\", \"weights occupied by g = f1.D^-1.R^-1\", \"g in e1.(words<=k), k=0,1,2,3\"}}, Flatten[u18gTab, 1]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
