  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (b)(i)-(iii) point A's polynomial f_A(B) = sum_k c_A,k tau_shape_k(theta1-3h)(B) over the 225 states, with c_A = cP2 on (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32) = (0,0,-2187/1600,0,-243/80,-27/43,0,1,320/1161) (adjoint c* on the shapes (1,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,1),(3,2): confirmed by the nonzero pattern; basisT columns are (1,T10,...,T32)).  Candidates: ladder-1 det2 with E(x) = yA^(-(x-th1)/h) over a pole set ns (weights 1/prod_{m!=n}(m-n)h on ns), second column Q^j(x-h) (\"minus\"), Q^j(x+h) (\"plus\") or x Q^j (\"x\"), divided by a Wronskian-type minor W(a,b) = Q2(th1-a h) Q3(th1-b h) - Q3(th1-a h) Q2(th1-b h) (or 1).  State independence of f_A/candidate over 225 states: max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|. *)\nu18cA = cP2[[1 ;; 9]];\nchecks[\"u18(b) c_A = cP2[1..9], support = shapes (1,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,1),(3,2)\"] = {u18cA, Pick[Most[shapes] /. {}, Unitize[u18cA[[2 ;;]]], 1]};\nu18fA = basisT . N[u18cA, precQ];\nu18yA = u14yA[wN[[2]]];\nchecks[\"u18(b) yA at P1\"] = u18yA;\nu18wg[ns_, n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[ns, n]}];\nu18br[ns_, f_] := Sum[u18wg[ns, n] f[th1 - n hN], {n, ns}];\nu18col2[B_, j_, x_, kind_] := Switch[kind, \"minus\", QU[B, j, x - hN], \"plus\", QU[B, j, x + hN], \"x\", x QU[B, j, x], \"same\", QU[B, j, x]];\nu18det2[B_, yy_, ns_, kind_] := Module[{Ef = Function[x, yy^(-(x - th1)/hN)]}, Det[Table[{-u18br[ns, Function[x, QU[B, j, x] Ef[x]]], u18br[ns, Function[x, u18col2[B, j, x, kind] Ef[x]]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]]];\nu18W[B_, a_, b_] := QU[B, 2, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - b hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - b hN];\nu18yN = N[u18yA, precQ];\nu18devOf[ns_, kind_, mn_] := Module[{num = Table[u18det2[B, u18yN, ns, kind], {B, nSt}], den, cand, rat}, den = If[mn === None, ConstantArray[1, nSt], Table[u18W[B, mn[[1]], mn[[2]]], {B, nSt}]]; cand = num/den; If[Min[Abs[cand]] < 10^-30, \"zero/ill-defined\", rat = u18fA/cand; sizeQ[constDev[rat]]]];\nu18cands = {{\"(i) n=0..2, minus\", {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\", {2, 3}}, {\"(ii) n=1..3, minus\", {1, 2, 3}, \"minus\", {3, 4}}, {\"(iii-a) n=0..3, plus\", {0, 1, 2, 3}, \"plus\", {3, 4}}, {\"(iii-b) n=0..3, x Q\", {0, 1, 2, 3}, \"x\", {3, 4}}, {\"control: n=0..3 minus (the B curve)\", {0, 1, 2, 3}, \"minus\", {3, 4}}};\n{u18tb, u18devTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{c[[1]], u18devOf[c[[2]], c[[3]], c[[4]]]}, {c, u18cands}]];\nchecks[\"u18(b)(i-iii) state-independence of f_A/candidate (specified minor)\"] = u18devTab;\nGrid[Join[{{\"candidate\", \"max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\"}}, u18devTab, {{\"time (s)\", u18tb}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
