   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (b) continued.  HIT: (iii-b) n = 0..3 with the second column x Q^j and minor W(th1-3h, th1-4h) is state independent to 7e-48; the scan below shows more hits.  Sensitivity: all minors W(a,b), 0<=a<b<=5, for every candidate; the constant; best two minors listed as {pair, dev}. *)\nu18minPairs = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 5], 2], #[[1]] < #[[2]] &];\nu18scan[ns_, kind_] := Module[{num = Table[u18det2[B, u18yN, ns, kind], {B, nSt}]}, SortBy[Table[{mp, With[{den = Table[u18W[B, mp[[1]], mp[[2]]], {B, nSt}]}, If[Min[Abs[den]] < 10^-30, 10^3, sizeQ[constDev[u18fA den/num]]]]}, {mp, u18minPairs}], #[[2]] &]];\nu18scanFull = Table[{c[[1]], u18scan[c[[2]], c[[3]]]}, {c, u18cands}];\nu18scanTab = Table[{s[[1]], Take[s[[2]], 3]}, {s, u18scanFull}];\nchecks[\"u18(b) best three minors per candidate (pair, dev)\"] = u18scanTab;\nGrid[Join[{{\"candidate\", \"best three minors (a,b) -> dev\"}}, u18scanTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
