   "value": "(* (b)(iv) symbolic y: for each candidate family fit every y-power coefficient of det2_ns,kind(y)/W(a,b) to span{1, tau_lambda(th1-3h)} (basisT, as in cells 19-20), rationalize the curve c(y), and solve exactly for the y with c(y) parallel to c_A.  ySym is the fresh symbol of cell 19. *)\nu18curve[ns_, kind_, mp_] := Module[{fy, dg, mind, cp, res, cy, cyx, parsol, rat},\n  fy = Table[Expand[u18det2[B, ySym, ns, kind]/u18W[B, mp[[1]], mp[[2]]]], {B, nSt}];\n  dg = Max[Exponent[fy, ySym]]; mind = Min[Table[Exponent[f, ySym, Min], {f, fy}]];\n  cp = Table[LeastSquares[basisT, Coefficient[fy, ySym, p]], {p, 0, dg}];\n  res = Max[Table[With[{cv = Coefficient[fy, ySym, p]}, If[nrmQ[cv] < 10^-40, 0, nrmQ[basisT . cp[[p + 1]] - cv]/nrmQ[cv]]], {p, 0, dg}]];\n  If[sizeQ[res] > 10^-30, Return[{\"not in span\", sizeQ[res], {mind, dg}}]];\n  rat = Rationalize[Chop[cp, 10^-40], 10^-30];\n  cyx = Factor /@ (ySym^Range[0, dg] . rat);\n  parsol = Solve[Join[Thread[Flatten[Minors[{cyx, u18cA}, 2]] == 0], {ySym != 0}], ySym];\n  {\"in span\", sizeQ[res], {mind, dg}, cyx, If[parsol === {}, \"none\", ySym /. parsol]}];\nu18curveSpecs = {{\"(i) n=0..2, minus, W(3,4)\", {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\", {3, 4}}, {\"(i') n=0..2, minus, W(2,3)\", {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\", {2, 3}}, {\"(ii) n=1..3, minus, W(3,4)\", {1, 2, 3}, \"minus\", {3, 4}}, {\"(iii-b) n=0..3, x Q, W(3,4)\", {0, 1, 2, 3}, \"x\", {3, 4}}};\n{u18tc, u18curves} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{c[[1]], u18curve[c[[2]], c[[3]], c[[4]]]}, {c, u18curveSpecs}]];\nchecks[\"u18(b)(iv) curves: {name, in span?, residual, y-degree range, c(y), y with c(y) || c_A}\"] = u18curves;\nGrid[Join[{{\"family\", \"in span?\", \"residual\", \"y-degree range\", \"c(y) on (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32)\", \"y (nonzero) with c(y) || c_A\"}}, Table[Flatten[{c[[1]], c[[2]]}], {c, u18curves}], {{\"time (s)\", u18tc, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
