  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (b)(v) general form of point A's polynomial: the adjoint's exact monomial formula (Two-rotations-det-overlap.md 5.4, the c(y) of the ladder-1 det2, order (1,T10,T11,T20,T21)):\n  F(h,t12,y) = (2h^2 (t12-h)(t12-2h)(t12-3h) y^4, 2h (t12-h)(t12-3h) y^3, (t12-h) y^2, (t12-3h) y^2, (2/(3h)) y),\nevaluated at y = yA = w2 (t12-h)/(t12-2h), against c_A of [3,1,0] on the shapes (1,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,1),(3,2) (entries 3,5,6,8,9 of the 9-vector) at the three numeric points of cell 12; the other four entries must vanish. Also against the exact curve of the previous cell at P1. *)\nu18F[h_, t12_, y_] := {2 h^2 (t12 - h) (t12 - 2 h) (t12 - 3 h) y^4, 2 h (t12 - h) (t12 - 3 h) y^3, (t12 - h) y^2, (t12 - 3 h) y^2, (2/(3 h)) y};\nu18pts = {{\"P1\", hN, thN, wN[[2]], runs[[1, 2]]}, {\"h=1/3\", 1/3, thN, wN[[2]], runs[[2, 2]]}, {\"theta=(1/5,-4/9), z', w'\", hN, {1/5, -4/9}, -2/5, runs[[3, 2]]}};\nu18pickPt[w2_, h_, t_, run_] := Select[\"nontrivial points\" /. run, ListQ[\"y(site2)\" /. #] && (\"y(site2)\" /. #)[[1]] == w2 (t[[1]] - t[[2]] - h)/(t[[1]] - t[[2]] - 2 h) &];\nu18cmp = Table[Module[{h = p[[2]], t12 = p[[3, 1]] - p[[3, 2]], w2 = p[[4]], pk, cv, yA, Fv, cm}, pk = u18pickPt[w2, h, p[[3]], p[[5]]]; yA = w2 (t12 - h)/(t12 - 2 h); cv = (\"c\" /. pk[[1]]); Fv = u18F[h, t12, yA]; cm = cv[[{3, 5, 6, 8, 9}]];\n   {p[[1]], Length[pk], cv, yA, Union[cv[[{1, 2, 4, 7}]]] === {0}, MatrixRank[{cm, Fv}] == 1, cm/cm[[4]] == Fv/Fv[[4]]}], {p, u18pts}];\nchecks[\"u18(b)(v) c_A vs adjoint monomial formula at y_A, 3 points: {pt, #A, other 4 entries zero, rank{c_A, F}=1}\"] = u18cmp[[All, {1, 2, 5, 6, 7}]];\n(* the P1 curve of the previous cell at y = yA versus F *)\nu18cyP1 = u18curves[[1, 2, 4]];\nchecks[\"u18(b)(v) exact curve c(y) of det2[n=0..2]/W(3,4) restricted to the 5 shapes ∥ F(h,t12,y) as a function of y (P1): ratios entrywise\"] = Simplify[(u18cyP1[[{3, 5, 6, 8, 9}]])/u18F[hN, θ12, ySym]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"point\", \"# A found\", \"other 4 entries zero\", \"c_A[5 shapes] ∥ F(h,t12,yA)\", \"exactly equal after T20-normalization\"}}, u18cmp[[All, {1, 2, 5, 6, 7}]], {{\"entrywise ratio curve/F at P1 (constants = scale)\", checks[\"u18(b)(v) exact curve c(y) of det2[n=0..2]/W(3,4) restricted to the 5 shapes ∥ F(h,t12,y) as a function of y (P1): ratios entrywise\"], \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
