  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (c) Q-dictionary for t1, t2.  Dual Baxter at x:  A Q(x+h) - t1 B Q(x) + t2 C Q(x-h) - t3 Q(x-2h) = 0,  A = nu3(x)nu3(x-h)nu3(x-2h), B = nu3(x-h)nu3(x-2h), C = nu3(x-2h), t3 = chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) nu3(x-2h).  Eliminate with two dual Q's (i,j) (Cramer):  with W_ij(a,b) = Q^i(a)Q^j(b) - Q^j(a)Q^i(b),\n  t1(x) = [ nu3(x) W(x+h,x-h) - chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h)/nu3(x-h) W(x-2h,x-h) ] / W(x,x-h),\n  t2(x) = [ nu3(x)nu3(x-h) W(x+h,x) - chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) W(x-2h,x) ] / W(x,x-h).\nHere Q = QU (with the z^(x/h) factors; the common factor at fixed x drops).  Verified on all 225 states against the interpolated eigenvalue polynomials valsSt (60 digits) at a generic x and at th1-3h, th1-2h, th1-h; for the pairs (2,3), (1,3), (1,2). *)\nu18Wd[B_, i_, j_, a_, b_] := QU[B, i, a] QU[B, j, b] - QU[B, j, a] QU[B, i, b];\nu18t3[x_] := χ3z nuP[1][x] nuP[2][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN];\nu18t1[B_, x_, {i_, j_}] := (nuP[3][x] u18Wd[B, i, j, x + hN, x - hN] - u18t3[x]/(nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN]) u18Wd[B, i, j, x - 2 hN, x - hN])/u18Wd[B, i, j, x, x - hN];\nu18t2[B_, x_, {i_, j_}] := (nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] u18Wd[B, i, j, x + hN, x] - u18t3[x]/nuP[3][x - 2 hN] u18Wd[B, i, j, x - 2 hN, x])/u18Wd[B, i, j, x, x - hN];\nu18tTrue[B_, a_, x_] := valsSt[[B, a]] /. uQ -> x;\nu18xs = {\"generic 3/11\" -> 3/11, \"th1-3h\" -> th1 - 3 hN, \"th1-2h\" -> th1 - 2 hN, \"th1-h\" -> th1 - hN};\nu18cramerTab = Table[{x[[1]], pr, sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18t1[B, x[[2]], pr] - u18tTrue[B, 1, x[[2]]]]/Abs[u18tTrue[B, 1, x[[2]]]], {B, nSt}]]], sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18t2[B, x[[2]], pr] - u18tTrue[B, 2, x[[2]]]]/Abs[u18tTrue[B, 2, x[[2]]]], {B, nSt}]]]}, {x, u18xs}, {pr, {{2, 3}, {1, 3}, {1, 2}}}];\nchecks[\"u18(c) Cramer t1, t2 from two dual Q's: max rel residual over 225 states, {x, pair, t1, t2}\"] = Flatten[u18cramerTab, 1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"x\", \"dual pair (i,j)\", \"max rel |t1 - t1_true|\", \"max rel |t2 - t2_true|\"}}, Flatten[u18cramerTab, 1]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
