   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (c) tau_lambda(th1-3h) for all nine shapes by CBR from the Cramer formulas.  Wp[a,b] = W_23(th1 - a h, th1 - b h) = Q^2(th1-ah) Q^3(th1-bh) - Q^3(th1-ah) Q^2(th1-bh), a < b a ladder-1 pair; t_a(v0 + k h) (k = 0,1,2) uses Wp at the points m-1..m+2, m = 3-k; t3 is the known qdet.  All coefficients are exact rationals (P1).  The notebook's cbr multiplies with Dot (operators); for scalars the products are turned into Times by the replacement Dot -> Times. *)\nwpN[a_, b_] := If[a < b, Wp[a, b], -Wp[b, a]];\nu18t1S[k_] := With[{m = 3 - k, x = v0 + k hN}, (nuP[3][x] wpN[m - 1, m + 1] - u18t3[x]/(nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN]) wpN[m + 2, m + 1])/wpN[m, m + 1]];\nu18t2S[k_] := With[{m = 3 - k, x = v0 + k hN}, (nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] wpN[m - 1, m] - u18t3[x]/nuP[3][x - 2 hN] wpN[m + 2, m])/wpN[m, m + 1]];\nu18tfS = Function[{a, xp}, tsym[a, Round[(xp - v0)/hN]]];\nu18tauRaw = Association[Table[λ -> (cbr[u18tfS, λ, v0, 1] /. Dot -> Times), {λ, shapes}]];\nu18subsT = Join[Table[tsym[1, k] -> u18t1S[k], {k, 0, 2}], Table[tsym[2, k] -> u18t2S[k], {k, 0, 2}], Table[tsym[3, k] -> u18t3[v0 + k hN], {k, 0, 2}]];\nu18tauE = Association[Table[λ -> (u18tauRaw[λ] /. u18subsT), {λ, shapes}]];\nu18tsymUsed = Association[Table[λ -> Union[Cases[u18tauRaw[λ], tsym[a_, k_] /; a < 3 :> {a, k}, Infinity]], {λ, shapes}]];\nu18ladder = Association[Table[λ -> Union[Flatten[Cases[u18tauE[λ], Wp[a_, b_] :> {a, b}, Infinity]]], {λ, shapes}]];\nu18WpVal[B_] := Association[Flatten[Table[Wp[a, b] -> u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - a hN, th1 - b hN], {a, 0, 5}, {b, a + 1, 5}]]];\n{u18tN, u18tauNum} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{wv = Normal[u18WpVal[B]]}, Association[Table[λ -> (u18tauE[λ] /. wv), {λ, shapes}]]], {B, nSt}]];\nu18resT = Table[{λ, sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18tauNum[[B]][λ] - basisT[[B, Position[shapes, λ][[1, 1]] + 1]]]/Abs[basisT[[B, Position[shapes, λ][[1, 1]] + 1]]], {B, nSt}]]]}, {λ, Most[shapes]}];\nchecks[\"u18(c) tau_lambda(th1-3h) from Cramer+CBR vs basisT (max rel residual over 225 states), 8 shapes\"] = u18resT;\n(* (3,3): the CBR determinant must vanish identically as a function of the Q's (T_(3,3)(th1-3h) is the zero operator); numerical zeros carry their accuracy, so report the bound 10^-(min accuracy) next to max |tau32| *)\nchecks[\"u18(c) tau_(3,3) from the dictionary: bound 10^-Accuracy (min over states), max |tau_(3,2)|\"] = {10.^-Min[Accuracy /@ Table[u18tauNum[[B]][{3, 3}], {B, nSt}]], Max[Abs[Table[N[u18tauNum[[B]][{3, 2}]], {B, nSt}]]]};\nchecks[\"u18(c) ladder pairs Wp used per shape\"] = Table[{λ, u18ladder[λ]}, {λ, shapes}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"shape\", \"t_a(v0+kh) used {a,k}\", \"ladder points n (Q at th1 - n h) used\", \"max rel |tau_dict - tau_basisT|\"}}, Table[{λ, u18tsymUsed[λ], Union[Flatten[u18ladder[λ]]], If[λ === {3, 3}, \"tau33 <= \" <> ToString[N[checks[\"u18(c) tau_(3,3) from the dictionary: bound 10^-Accuracy (min over states), max |tau_(3,2)|\"][[1]], 3]], u18resT[[Position[Most[shapes], λ][[1, 1]], 2]]]}, {λ, shapes}], {{\"time (s)\", u18tN, \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
