  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* end-to-end for point A (cf. cell 21 for point B): Phi_A = f1_A (x) f2_A at w2 = 7/3 (P1; the pipeline's covectors, product by construction), and  <Phi_A|psi>/<x0|psi>  vs  det6[B, vac(w1,w2)]/Psi_Q x det2^{n=0..2}[Q_B; yA]/minor1  over the 225 states.  det2 = sum_{n,n' in {0,1,2}} w_n w_n' yA^(n+n') Wp[n, n'+1] (Wp = W_23, antisymmetric, Wp[0,1] = 0). *)\nu18PhiA = kron[u14Af1[7/3], u14Af2[7/3]];\nu18ovlA = Table[u18PhiA . vecSt[[B]], {B, nSt}];\nu18f2det = Table[u18det2[B, N[u18yA, precQ], {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\"]/minor1[B], {B, nSt}];\nu18ratA = Table[(u18ovlA[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]])/((det6List[[B]]/psiQ[B]) u18f2det[[B]]), {B, nSt}];\nchecks[\"u18 end-to-end A: <Phi_A|psi>/<x0|psi> ∝ det6/Psi_Q × det2[n=0..2; yA]/minor1 (max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|, 225 states)\"] = sizeQ[constDev[u18ratA]];\nchecks[\"u18 end-to-end A: the constant\"] = N[u18ratA[[1]], 12];\n(* explicit Wp-sum form of det2 and its agreement with u18det2 *)\nu18det2W[B_, yy_, ns_] := Sum[u18wg[ns, n] u18wg[ns, np] yy^(n + np) If[n == np + 1, 0, Which[n < np + 1, 1, True, -1] u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - Min[n, np + 1] hN, th1 - Max[n, np + 1] hN]], {n, ns}, {np, ns}];\nchecks[\"u18 det2 = sum w_n w_n' y^(n+n') Wp[n,n'+1]: max rel diff over states\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18det2W[B, N[u18yA, precQ], {0, 1, 2}] - u18det2[B, N[u18yA, precQ], {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\"]]/Abs[u18det2[B, N[u18yA, precQ], {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\"]], {B, nSt}]]];\n(* controls: a wrong y breaks it; the point-B insertion y* with the same pole set *)\nu18ctrl = Table[With[{f = Table[u18det2[B, N[yy, precQ], {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\"]/minor1[B], {B, nSt}]}, N[constDev[Table[(u18ovlA[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]])/((det6List[[B]]/psiQ[B]) f[[B]]), {B, nSt}]], 3]], {yy, {-63/43, 2}}];\nchecks[\"u18 end-to-end A controls (y = -63/43, 2): should fail\"] = u18ctrl;\n(* the identity between the two descriptions of the same function: sum c_A tau (points up to th1-5h) and det2 (points up to th1-4h) *)\nGrid[{{\"max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\", checks[\"u18 end-to-end A: <Phi_A|psi>/<x0|psi> ∝ det6/Psi_Q × det2[n=0..2; yA]/minor1 (max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|, 225 states)\"]}, {\"constant\", checks[\"u18 end-to-end A: the constant\"]}, {\"det2 Wp-sum form agrees\", checks[\"u18 det2 = sum w_n w_n' y^(n+n') Wp[n,n'+1]: max rel diff over states\"]}, {\"controls y = -63/43, 2\", u18ctrl}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
