  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (c) the dictionary written out.  Vanishing factors at the evaluation points; which t_a(th1 - m h) are needed; the CBR determinants in t-symbols; and the explicit rational functions of the Wp for the shapes of point A.  NB at x = v0 = th1-3h the factor nu1(x) = prod_s (x - th_s + 3h) contains (x - th1 + 3h) = 0, so t3(th1-3h) = 0 and the second terms of t1, t2 drop out there. *)\nu18vanTab = Table[{ToString[x[[1]]], {\"nu1(x)\" -> (nuP[1][x[[2]]] == 0), \"nu2(x-h)\" -> (nuP[2][x[[2]] - hN] == 0), \"nu3(x)\" -> (nuP[3][x[[2]]] == 0), \"nu3(x-h)\" -> (nuP[3][x[[2]] - hN] == 0), \"nu3(x-2h)\" -> (nuP[3][x[[2]] - 2 hN] == 0), \"t3(x)\" -> (u18t3[x[[2]]] == 0)}}, {x, {\"th1-3h\" -> th1 - 3 hN, \"th1-2h\" -> th1 - 2 hN, \"th1-h\" -> th1 - hN, \"th1\" -> th1, \"th1+h\" -> th1 + hN}}];\nchecks[\"u18(c) zero factors at x = th1-3h .. th1+h\"] = u18vanTab;\nu18tsymUsed = Association[Table[λ -> Union[Cases[u18tauRaw[λ], tsym[a_, k_] /; a < 3 :> {a, k}, {0, Infinity}]], {λ, shapes}]];\nu18ladder = Association[Table[λ -> Union[Flatten[Cases[u18tauE[λ], Wp[a_, b_] :> {a, b}, {0, Infinity}]]], {λ, shapes}]];\n(* exact t1, t2 at the three points as rational functions of Wp, and the shapes of point A *)\nu18tExpl = Table[{\"m=\" <> ToString[m], \"t1\" -> Together[u18t1S[3 - m]], \"t2\" -> Together[u18t2S[3 - m]], \"t3\" -> u18t3[v0 + (3 - m) hN]}, {m, 3, 1, -1}];\nu18shapesA = {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}};\nu18tauShort = Table[λ -> TimeConstrained[Together[u18tauE[λ]], 60, \"too large\"], {λ, u18shapesA}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"x\", \"vanishing: nu1(x), nu2(x-h), nu3(x), nu3(x-h), nu3(x-2h), t3(x)\"}}, u18vanTab, {{\"t1, t2, t3 at th1-mh (Wp[a,b] = W23(th1-ah, th1-bh))\", Column[u18tExpl]}}, Table[{\"tau_\" <> ToString[λ] <> \"(th1-3h): CBR in t's; t's used; ladder points\", Column[{u18tauRaw[λ], u18tsymUsed[λ], Union[Flatten[u18ladder[λ]]]}]}, {λ, shapes}], Table[{\"explicit tau_\" <> ToString[s[[1]]], s[[2]]}, {s, u18tauShort}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
