   "value": "(* (c) general (h, theta12, chi3) form of the dictionary at v0 = th1-3h.  The exact P1 output above collapses the five shapes of point A to single Wronskians over minor1 = Wp[3,4] (with Wp[0,1] = 0 and one Pluecker relation).  Redo it symbolically: nu_n(x) = prod_s (x - th_s + h Lambda_n), Lambda = (3,1,0), th2 = th1 - t12, chi3 symbolic, Wp[a,b] symbols; the CBR determinants then Together. *)\nClear[hS, t12S, th1S, chiS];\nnuS[n_, x_] := Product[x - ths + hS Λ[[n]], {ths, {th1S, th1S - t12S}}];\nt3Sx[x_] := chiS nuS[1, x] nuS[2, x - hS] nuS[3, x - 2 hS];\nu18t1G[k_] := With[{m = 3 - k, x = th1S - (3 - k) hS}, (nuS[3, x] wpN[m - 1, m + 1] - t3Sx[x]/(nuS[3, x - hS] nuS[3, x - 2 hS]) wpN[m + 2, m + 1])/wpN[m, m + 1]];\nu18t2G[k_] := With[{m = 3 - k, x = th1S - (3 - k) hS}, (nuS[3, x] nuS[3, x - hS] wpN[m - 1, m] - t3Sx[x]/nuS[3, x - 2 hS] wpN[m + 2, m])/wpN[m, m + 1]];\nu18subsG = Join[Table[tsym[1, k] -> u18t1G[k], {k, 0, 2}], Table[tsym[2, k] -> u18t2G[k], {k, 0, 2}], Table[tsym[3, k] -> t3Sx[th1S - (3 - k) hS], {k, 0, 2}]];\nu18tauG = Association[Table[λ -> Factor[Together[(u18tauRaw[λ] /. u18subsG) /. Wp[0, 1] -> 0]], {λ, Most[shapes]}]];\nchecks[\"u18(c) general tau (h, t12, chi3 symbolic), Wp[0,1] = 0\"] = u18tauG;\nchecks[\"u18(c) chi3 dependence of tau_lambda\"] = Table[{λ, FreeQ[u18tauG[λ], chiS]}, {λ, Most[shapes]}];\n(* agreement of the symbolic form with the numeric P1 dictionary *)\nu18P1rule = {hS -> hN, t12S -> θ12, th1S -> thN[[1]], chiS -> χ3z};\nchecks[\"u18(c) symbolic tau at P1 == exact P1 dictionary (all 8 shapes)\"] = And @@ Table[Together[(u18tauG[λ] /. u18P1rule) - (u18tauE[λ] /. Wp[0, 1] -> 0)] === 0, {λ, Most[shapes]}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"shape\", \"tau_lambda(th1-3h), symbolic in h, t12 = th1-th2, chi3 (Wp[0,1] = 0)\"}}, Table[{λ, u18tauG[λ]}, {λ, Most[shapes]}], {{\"chi3-free?\", checks[\"u18(c) chi3 dependence of tau_lambda\"]}, {\"P1 agreement\", checks[\"u18(c) symbolic tau at P1 == exact P1 dictionary (all 8 shapes)\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
