  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (c) the monomial reading of the symbolic output (with Wp[0,1] = 0 and the Pluecker relation Wp[a,b]Wp[c,d] - Wp[a,c]Wp[b,d] + Wp[a,d]Wp[b,c] = 0 of the 2-row matrix (Q^2;Q^3) at the ladder points, which rewrites the products Wp[0,2]Wp[1,4]/Wp[1,2], Wp[0,2]Wp[1,3]/Wp[1,2] and (Wp[1,2]Wp[3,4]-Wp[1,3]Wp[2,4])/Wp[2,3] as single Wp):\n  tau_(l1,l2)(th1-3h) = C_(l1,l2) * Wp[3-l1, 4-l2]/Wp[3,4],   C = prod_{k=4-l1}^{3} nu3(th1-kh) * prod_{k=5-l2}^{4} nu3(th1-kh),  nu3(x) = prod_s (x-th_s)   (nu3(th1-kh) = kh(kh-t12)),\nwith Wp[a,b] = W_23(th1-ah, th1-bh).  (3,3) -> Wp[0,1] = 0 (the vanishing operator); (0,0) -> 1.  Verified on all 225 states against basisT, and against the symbolic output of the previous cell. *)\nu18Cl[{l1_, l2_}] := Product[nuP[3][th1 - k hN], {k, 4 - l1, 3}] Product[nuP[3][th1 - k hN], {k, 5 - l2, 4}];\nu18tauCl[B_, {l1_, l2_}] := u18Cl[{l1, l2}] u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - (3 - l1) hN, th1 - (4 - l2) hN]/u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - 3 hN, th1 - 4 hN];\nu18resCl = Table[{λ, sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18tauCl[B, λ] - basisT[[B, Position[shapes, λ][[1, 1]] + 1]]]/Abs[basisT[[B, Position[shapes, λ][[1, 1]] + 1]]], {B, nSt}]]]}, {λ, Most[shapes]}];\nchecks[\"u18(c) closed form tau_l = C_l Wp[3-l1,4-l2]/Wp[3,4] vs basisT (max rel residual, 225 states, 8 shapes)\"] = u18resCl;\nchecks[\"u18(c) closed form: (3,3) -> Wp[0,1] = 0 (max rel size), C_(0,0) = 1\"] = {sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1, th1 - hN]]/(Abs[QU[B, 2, th1] QU[B, 3, th1 - hN]] + Abs[QU[B, 3, th1] QU[B, 2, th1 - hN]]), {B, nSt}]]], u18Cl[{0, 0}] == 1};\nu18Cgen = Table[λ -> Factor[Product[k hS (k hS - t12S), {k, 4 - λ[[1]], 3}] Product[k hS (k hS - t12S), {k, 5 - λ[[2]], 4}]], {λ, Most[shapes]}];\n(* symbolic output of the previous cell (before the Pluecker rewriting), evaluated at P1 and at the Q's of a state, against the closed form and the symbolic C *)\nchecks[\"u18(c) symbolic tau (prev. cell) at P1 and state B = 1,100,225 == closed form (max rel diff)\"] = Max[Table[With[{wv = Normal[u18WpVal[B]]}, Abs[(u18tauG[λ] /. u18P1rule /. wv)/u18tauCl[B, λ] - 1]], {B, {1, 100, 225}}, {λ, Most[shapes]}]] // sizeQ;\nchecks[\"u18(c) C_lambda symbolic at P1 == numeric C_lambda\"] = And @@ Table[(Last[u18Cgen[[i]]] /. {hS -> hN, t12S -> θ12}) == u18Cl[First[u18Cgen[[i]]]], {i, 8}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"shape\", \"C_lambda (h, t12 = th1 - th2)\", \"max rel |closed form - basisT|\"}}, Table[{u18Cgen[[i, 1]], u18Cgen[[i, 2]], u18resCl[[i, 2]]}, {i, 8}], {{\"(3,3): Wp[0,1] rel size; C_(0,0) = 1\", checks[\"u18(c) closed form: (3,3) -> Wp[0,1] = 0 (max rel size), C_(0,0) = 1\"], \"\"}, {\"symbolic vs closed form (states 1,100,225); C check\", {checks[\"u18(c) symbolic tau (prev. cell) at P1 and state B = 1,100,225 == closed form (max rel diff)\"], checks[\"u18(c) C_lambda symbolic at P1 == numeric C_lambda\"]}, \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
