  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (b) general form, symbolic: point A's polynomial  f_A = sum_k F_k(h,t12,y) tau_{shape_k}  with F the adjoint monomial formula (cell 52), shapes (1,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,1),(3,2), is by the dictionary  f_A = (1/Wp[3,4]) sum_k F_k C_k Wp[pair_k];  the ladder-1 det2 over n = 0..2 with insertion y^(-(x-th1)/h) is  h^4 det2 = (y^4/4) Wp[2,3] - (y^3/2) Wp[1,3] + (3y^2/4) Wp[1,2] + (y^2/4) Wp[0,3] - (y/2) Wp[0,2]  (using Wp[0,1] = 0, weights w_n = 1/prod_{m != n}(m-n)h on {0,1,2}).  The two coincide up to the scalar K(h,t12) for ALL y: *)\nu18Fsym = {2 hS^2 (t12S - hS) (t12S - 2 hS) (t12S - 3 hS) yS^4, 2 hS (t12S - hS) (t12S - 3 hS) yS^3, (t12S - hS) yS^2, (t12S - 3 hS) yS^2, (2/(3 hS)) yS};\nu18shp = {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}};\nu18pairs = {{2, 3}, {1, 3}, {1, 2}, {0, 3}, {0, 2}};\nu18CgenOf[λ_] := Product[k hS (k hS - t12S), {k, 4 - λ[[1]], 3}] Product[k hS (k hS - t12S), {k, 5 - λ[[2]], 4}];\nu18FC = Table[u18Fsym[[k]] u18CgenOf[u18shp[[k]]], {k, 5}];\nu18Dd = {yS^4/4, -yS^3/2, 3 yS^2/4, yS^2/4, -yS/2}/hS^4;\nu18K = Factor[u18FC/u18Dd];\nchecks[\"u18(b) symbolic: F_k C_k / D_k = one function K(h,t12) for all five k and all y\"] = {Length[DeleteDuplicates[u18K]] == 1, u18K[[1]]};\n(* explicit det2 Wp-expansion check against the numeric u18det2 at a generic y (second numeric y: 2) *)\nu18d2Wp[B_, yy_] := (yy^4/4 u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - 2 hN, th1 - 3 hN] - yy^3/2 u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - hN, th1 - 3 hN] + 3 yy^2/4 u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1 - hN, th1 - 2 hN] + yy^2/4 u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1, th1 - 3 hN] - yy/2 u18Wd[B, 2, 3, th1, th1 - 2 hN])/hN^4;\nchecks[\"u18(b) det2 Wp-expansion above == u18det2[n=0..2] (y = 2, -63/8; max rel diff)\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[Abs[u18d2Wp[B, N[yy, precQ]]/u18det2[B, N[yy, precQ], {0, 1, 2}, \"minus\"] - 1], {B, nSt}, {yy, {2, -63/8}}]]];\nGrid[{{\"F_k C_k / D_k: single function of (h, t12)?\", checks[\"u18(b) symbolic: F_k C_k / D_k = one function K(h,t12) for all five k and all y\"]}, {\"det2 Wp-expansion verified numerically\", checks[\"u18(b) det2 Wp-expansion above == u18det2[n=0..2] (y = 2, -63/8; max rel diff)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
