  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (a, parameter dependence of the dressing constants) K12 = beta12 (w2-z1)/w2 and K13 = gamma13 (w2-z1)(yA-z3)/w2^2, with g = f1.rho(Dy_z[w2])^-1.R^-1 = e1 (1 + beta12 E12 + gamma13 E13 + delta E12E23), at P1 K12 = 2/25, K13 = 189/704.  One-parameter variations of (h, theta, z_k, w1) around P1 (fresh pipeline run per point; w2 = 7/3). *)\nu18dress[zz_, w1_, hh_, th_, w2_] := Module[{run, yA, pk, f1, R, g, s, t12 = th[[1]] - th[[2]]}, run = u14pipe[zz, {w1, w2, 3/5}, hh, th]; yA = w2 (t12 - hh)/(t12 - 2 hh); pk = Select[\"nontrivial points\" /. run, ListQ[\"y(site2)\" /. #] && (\"y(site2)\" /. #)[[1]] == yA &]; If[Length[pk] != 1, Return[$Failed]]; f1 = Normal[\"f1\" /. pk[[1]]]; R = Normal[Rrot[zz, {w1, yA, 3/5}]]; g = f1 . Inverse[ρdiag[1/(w2 - zz)]] . Inverse[R]; s = LinearSolve[Transpose[u18wv[[{1, 2, 3, 4}]]], g]; If[MatrixRank[Append[u18wv[[{1, 2, 3, 4}]], g]] != 4, Return[\"not in span\"]]; s = s/s[[1]]; {s[[2]] (w2 - zz[[1]])/w2, s[[3]] (w2 - zz[[1]]) (yA - zz[[3]])/w2^2, s[[3]] == 2 s[[4]]}];\nu18var = {{\"P1\", zN, 5/2, hN, thN}, {\"w1=7/3\", zN, 7/3, hN, thN}, {\"w1=-4/5\", zN, -4/5, hN, thN}, {\"h=1/3\", zN, 5/2, 1/3, thN}, {\"h=2/3\", zN, 5/2, 2/3, thN}, {\"th=(1/5,-4/9)\", zN, 5/2, hN, {1/5, -4/9}}, {\"th=(3/7,-1/5)\", zN, 5/2, hN, {3/7, -1/5}}, {\"z1=7/4\", {7/4, 5/4, 2/3}, 5/2, hN, thN}, {\"z2=7/6\", {3/2, 7/6, 2/3}, 5/2, hN, thN}, {\"z3=3/7\", {3/2, 5/4, 3/7}, 5/2, hN, thN}};\n{u18tv, u18dressTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{v[[1]], u18dress[v[[2]], v[[3]], v[[4]], v[[5]], 7/3]}, {v, u18var}]];\nchecks[\"u18(a) K12, K13, gamma=2 delta at one-parameter variations (w2 = 7/3)\"] = u18dressTab;\nGrid[Join[{{\"variation\", \"{K12, K13, gamma = 2 delta}\"}}, u18dressTab, {{\"time (s)\", u18tv}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
