   "value": "(* (a, constants) from the one-parameter variations: K12 is h-, theta-, z3-independent and K12 = (z1-z2)(w1-z1)/(2 z2 (w1-z2)) at the six variations (check below), i.e. beta12 = r1 (z1-z2) w2/(2 z2 (w2-z1)) with the vacuum Gauss parameter r1 = (w1-z1)/(w1-z2).  K13 depends on h and theta (and z, w1): log-linear fit over 28 random parameter points against monomials in {h, t12, t12-h, ..., t12-4h, z_i - z_j, z_i, w1 - z_i}. *)\nu18K12f[zz_, w1_] := (zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[1]])/(2 zz[[2]] (w1 - zz[[2]]));\nchecks[\"u18(a) K12 == (z1-z2)(w1-z1)/(2 z2 (w1-z2)) at the 10 variations\"] = Table[u18dressTab[[i, 2, 1]] == u18K12f[u18var[[i, 2]], u18var[[i, 3]]], {i, 10}];\nSeedRandom[2810];\nu18rndPar = Table[Module[{zz, w1, hh, th}, While[True, zz = Table[RandomInteger[{2, 9}]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}], 3]; w1 = RandomInteger[{-9, 9}]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}]; hh = RandomInteger[{1, 6}]/RandomInteger[{3, 8}]; th = {RandomInteger[{-5, 5}]/RandomInteger[{3, 9}], RandomInteger[{-5, 5}]/RandomInteger[{3, 9}]}; If[Length[Union[zz]] == 3 && ! MemberQ[zz, w1] && Length[Union[Join[zz, {7/3, w1, 3/5}]]] == 6 && FreeQ[Table[th[[1]] - th[[2]] - k hh, {k, 0, 4}], 0] && th[[1]] != th[[2]], Break[]]]; {zz, w1, hh, th}], {28}];\n{u18tr, u18rndK} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{r = u18dress[p[[1]], p[[2]], p[[3]], p[[4]], 7/3]}, {p, r}], {p, u18rndPar}]];\nu18okK = Select[u18rndK, ListQ[#[[2]]] &];\nchecks[\"u18(a) random parameter points usable (of 28), gamma = 2 delta at all\"] = {Length[u18okK], And @@ (#[[2, 3]] & /@ u18okK)};\nchecks[\"u18(a) K12 formula at the random points\"] = And @@ (#[[2, 1]] == u18K12f[#[[1, 1]], #[[1, 2]]] & /@ u18okK);\nu18facK[{zz_, w1_, hh_, th_}] := With[{t = th[[1]] - th[[2]]}, {hh, t, t - hh, t - 2 hh, t - 3 hh, t - 4 hh, zz[[1]] - zz[[2]], zz[[1]] - zz[[3]], zz[[2]] - zz[[3]], zz[[1]], zz[[2]], zz[[3]], w1 - zz[[1]], w1 - zz[[2]], w1 - zz[[3]]}];\nu18facKn = {\"h\", \"t\", \"t-h\", \"t-2h\", \"t-3h\", \"t-4h\", \"z1-z2\", \"z1-z3\", \"z2-z3\", \"z1\", \"z2\", \"z3\", \"w1-z1\", \"w1-z2\", \"w1-z3\"};\nu18Kfit = Module[{A = Table[Join[{1}, Log[Abs[u18facK[p[[1]]]]]], {p, u18okK}], b = Log[Abs[#[[2, 2]] & /@ u18okK]], sol}, sol = LeastSquares[N[A, 30], N[b, 30]]; {Length[u18okK], MatrixRank[N[A, 30]], sol, Max[Abs[N[A, 30] . sol - N[b, 30]]]}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", u18tr}, {\"usable points, rank of log design\", u18Kfit[[1 ;; 2]]}, {\"fit exponents of \" <> ToString[u18facKn], N[u18Kfit[[3]], 4]}, {\"max log residual\", u18Kfit[[4]]}, {\"K12 formula holds at all random points\", checks[\"u18(a) K12 formula at the random points\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
