  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (a) closed forms of the dressing (exact rational equality, not fits): with t = th1 - th2,\n  g = f1.rho(Dy_z[w2])^-1.R^-1 = e1 (1 + beta E12 + gamma E13 + delta E12E23),  gamma = 2 delta,\n  beta  = K12 w2/(w2-z1),            K12 = (z1-z2)(w1-z1) / (2 z2 (w1-z2)),\n  gamma = K13 w2^2/((w2-z1)(yA-z3)), K13 = (1/4) (t-h)/(t-2h) (z1-z3)(z2-z3)(w1-z1) / (z2 z3 (w1-z3)),  yA = w2 (t-h)/(t-2h).\nChecked at the 18 w2 of P1, the 10 one-parameter variations and the 28 random parameter points. *)\nu18K13f[zz_, w1_, hh_, th_] := With[{t = th[[1]] - th[[2]]}, (1/4) (t - hh)/(t - 2 hh) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]) (zz[[2]] - zz[[3]]) (w1 - zz[[1]])/(zz[[2]] zz[[3]] (w1 - zz[[3]]))];\nu18betaF[w2_] := u18K12f[zN, u13w1] w2/(w2 - zN[[1]]);\nu18gammaF[w2_] := u18K13f[zN, u13w1, hN, thN] w2^2/((w2 - zN[[1]]) (u14yA[w2] - zN[[3]]));\nchecks[\"u18(a) beta12, gamma13, delta closed forms at the 18 w2 of P1 (exact)\"] = And @@ Table[u18cfs[w2][[2]] == u18betaF[w2] && u18cfs[w2][[3]] == u18gammaF[w2] && u18cfs[w2][[4]] == u18gammaF[w2]/2, {w2, u18allW2}];\nchecks[\"u18(a) K13 closed form at the 10 variations and 28 random points (exact)\"] = {And @@ Table[u18dressTab[[i, 2, 2]] == u18K13f[u18var[[i, 2]], u18var[[i, 3]], u18var[[i, 4]], u18var[[i, 5]]], {i, 10}], And @@ (#[[2, 2]] == u18K13f @@ #[[1]] & /@ u18okK)};\nGrid[{{\"closed forms of (beta12, gamma13, delta) at the 18 w2 of P1\", checks[\"u18(a) beta12, gamma13, delta closed forms at the 18 w2 of P1 (exact)\"]}, {\"K13 closed form at 10 variations / 28 random points\", checks[\"u18(a) K13 closed form at the 10 variations and 28 random points (exact)\"]}, {\"K12 closed form at the 10 variations / 28 random points\", {checks[\"u18(a) K12 == (z1-z2)(w1-z1)/(2 z2 (w1-z2)) at the 10 variations\"], checks[\"u18(a) K12 formula at the random points\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
