      {
       "data": "Out[997]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{item} & \\text{result}\\\\\\hline\\text{(a) f1\\_A in span\\{e1,E12,E23,E13\\}.R.D (rank 5 vs 4), D = Dy[w2], Dy[yA], 1, all 15 subsets, 6 w2} & \\text{not a member (no subset, no D)}\\\\\\hline\\text{(a) after undoing R and D = Dy[w2]: g = f1.D\\^{}-1.R\\^{}-1 occupies only weights (3,1,0),(2,2,0),(2,1,1); minimal span of descendants} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\text{e1} & \\text{e1E12} & \\text{e1E13} & \\text{e1E12E23}\\\\\\text{e1} & \\text{e1E12} & \\text{e1E13} & \\text{e1E23E12}\\\\\\text{e1} & \\text{e1E12} & \\text{e1E12E23} & \\text{e1E23E12}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{(a) g = e1 (1 + beta E12 + gamma (E13 + E12E23/2)), exact at 18 w2 / 10 variations / 28 random points} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{(b)(i) f\\_A / [det2 n=0..2, minus, W(2,3)] state independence (spec minor)} & 22.8\\\\\\hline\\text{(b)(i) same with minor1 = W(3,4)} & 7.313067652353907\\times 10^{-48}\\\\\\hline\\text{(b)(ii) n=1..3 minus, W(3,4)} & 259\\\\\\hline\\text{(b)(iii) n=0..3: second column Q\\^{}j(x+h) / x Q\\^{}j (W(3,4))} & \\left\\{4.01,7.313073531047003\\times 10^{-48}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{(b)(iv) curves: n=0..2 in span, c(y) || c\\_A only at y} & \\left\\{-\\frac{63… [latex truncated: 2176 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
